name issue_466_scene_change_very_low_capacity
describe 100 kbps link (as very_low_capacity), a scene cut every 5 s: 5 delta frames at 3x
duration 40s
scene_change 5s 5 3
at 0s capacity=100kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
# Issue #466 (see issue_466_overshoot_1mbps.scn). At the encoder's minimum
# (52 kbps) the cuts change little on seeds 1-3 (446-489 frames dropped, 422-466
# without); the lines lock in the model's operating point, and parity is
# judged on compare-webrtc.
expect video.encoder_target_avg_kbps > 45
expect video.avg_kbps < 40
